# Git Workflow

- Work on branch `develop` branched from `main`.
- One-line conventional commits in English: `feat`, `fix`, `test`, `docs`, `chore`, `ci`.
- One commit per plan slice; run `go test -race -shuffle=on ./...` before each commit.
- Do not push unless the user asks.
